g>Comments</a></li><li class=\"devlog_link\"><a class=\"action_btn\" href=\"https://zortanis.itch.io/arid-frontiers/devlog\"><svg width=\"18\" height=\"18\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" fill=\"none\" class=\"svgicon icon_news\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" version=\"1.1\" aria-hidden role=\"img\"><rect x=\"1\" y=\"3\" width=\"22\" height=\"18\" rx=\"2\" ry=\"2\"></rect><line x1=\"6\" y1=\"8\" x2=\"18\" y2=\"8\"></line><line x1=\"6\" y1=\"12\" x2=\"18\" y2=\"12\"></line><line x1=\"6\" y1=\"16\" x2=\"18\" y2=\"16\"></line></svg>Devlog</a></li><li><a data-label=\"related_btn\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"action_btn related_games_btn\" href=\"https://itch.io/games-like/4891636/arid-frontiers\"><svg width=\"18\" height=\"18\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" fill=\"none\" class=\"svgicon icon_map\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" version=\"1.1\" aria-hidden role=\"img\"><polygon points=\"1 6 1 22 8 18 16 22 23 18 23 2 16 6 8 2 1 6\"></polygon><line x1=\"8\" y1=\"2\" x2=\"8\" y2=\"18\"></line><line x1=\"16\" y1=\"6\" x2=\"16\" y2=\"22\"></line></svg> <span class=\"full_label\">Related games</span><span class=\"mobile_label\">Related</span></a></li></ul><script type=\"text/javascript\">new I.GameUserTools('#user_tools')</script><div id=\"wrapper\" class=\"main wrapper game_page_wrapper\"><div id=\"inner_column\" class=\"inner_column size_large family_lato\"><div class=\"header align_center has_image\" id=\"header\"><img src=\"https://img.itch.zone/aW1nLzI5NDI4MzE0LnBuZw==/original/axytea.png\" alt=\"Arid Frontiers\"/><h1 class=\"game_title\" itemprop=\"name\">Arid Frontiers</h1></div><div id=\"view_html_game_4905821\" class=\"view_html_game_page view_game_page page_widget base_widget buy_on_top ready\"><div id=\"html_embed_1995836\" class=\"html_embed_widget base_widget embed_wrapper\"><div data-height=\"540\" style=\"width: 960px; height: 540px\" class=\"game_frame game_pending\" data-width=\"960\"><button class=\"fullscreen_btn\" title=\"Enter fullscreen\"><img src=\"https://itch.io/static/images/enlarge.svg?1788406861\"/></button><div class=\"iframe_placeholder\" data-iframe=\"&lt;iframe src=&quot;https://html-classic.itch.zone/html/19058910/index.html?v=1788262690&quot; frameborder=&quot;0&quot; allowfullscreen=&quot;true&quot; scrolling=&quot;no&quot; allowtransparency=&quot;true&quot; id=&quot;game_drop&quot; mozallowfullscreen=&quot;true&quot; msallowfullscreen=&quot;true&quot; allow=&quot;autoplay; fullscreen *; geolocation; microphone; camera; midi; monetization; xr-spatial-tracking; gamepad; gyroscope; accelerometer; xr; cross-origin-isolated; web-share&quot; webkitallowfullscreen=&quot;true&quot;&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;\"><button class=\"button load_iframe_btn\"><svg width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" fill=\"none\" class=\"svgicon icon_play\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" version=\"1.1\" aria-hidden role=\"img\"><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"10\"></circle><polygon points=\"10 8 16 12 10 16 10 8\"></polygon></svg> Run game</button></div></div></div><div class=\"donate\"><a data-donate=\"false\" class=\"button donate_btn\" href=\"https://zortanis.itch.io/arid-frontiers/purchase\">Download Now</a></div><div class=\"columns\"><div class=\"left_col column\"><div class=\"formatted_description user_formatted\"><p>It is Day 4. Sarah is framing a cabin. Jonah is in the field. Emmett is hauling wood. The fire is lit, the beds have no walls yet, and something big is moving at the tree line.</p>\r\n<p>That is <strong>Arid Frontiers</strong>. A real-time, pause-anytime colony sim on the early American frontier. You pick a landing site, then you watch settlers farm, build, get sick, make friends, and start fights you did not order.</p>\r\n<p>Play in the browser. First camp is about 20 to 40 minutes. Two starts: Lone Settler or Frontier Family.</p>\r\n<h2>What&#x27;s in this pre-alpha</h2>\r\n<p>Procedural landing sites. Autonomous settlers with needs, skills, and relationships. Farming, construction, workshops, research, weather, wildlife, illness, visitors, and save/load.</p>\r\n<p>This is still pre-alpha. Balance, art, and old saves can break. If a settler almost starves on night one, post the screenshot.</p>\r\n<h2>Play with us</h2>\r\n<p>Saturday playtests, 7:00-8:30pm ET. <a href=\"https://voxelpulsegames.com/join/website\" referrerpolicy=\"origin\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\">Join Discord</a> \u00b7 <a href=\"https://voxelpulsegames.com\" referrerpolicy=\"origin\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\">voxelpulsegames.com</a></p>\r\n<h2>Controls</h2>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Left click: select / place</li>\r\n<li>Right click: context or cancel</li>\r\n<li>Mouse wheel: zoom</li>\r\n<li>Middle mouse drag or WASD: pan</li>\r\n<li>P: pause or resume</li>\r\n<li>M: colony management</li>\r\n<li>I: settler dossier</li>\r\n<li>C: build planner</li>\r\n<li>T: workshops and research</li>\r\n<li>U: settlement overview</li>\r\n<li>F1: in-game guide</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p>Most planning works while paused. Desktop browser, mouse and keyboard. Not built for phones.</p></div><div class=\"more_information_toggle\"><div class=\"toggle_row\"><a class=\"toggle_info_btn\" href=\"javascript:void(0)\">More information<svg height=\"6\" width=\"12\" role=\"img\" class=\"svgicon icon_down_tick\" viewBox=\"0 0 37 20\" aria-hidden version=\"1.1\"><path d=\"m2.0858 0c-1.1535 0-2.0858 0.86469-2.0858 1.9331 0 0.5139 0.21354 1.0183 0.38704 1.1881l18.113 16.879 18.112-16.879c0.174-0.1696 0.388-0.674 0.388-1.1879 0-1.0684-0.932-1.9331-2.086-1.9331-0.577 0-1.111 0.23008-1.49 0.57992l-14.924 13.894-14.925-13.893c-0.3777-0.34998-0.9134-0.581-1.4902-0.581z\"/></svg></a></div><div class=\"info_panel_wrapper\"><div id=\"game_info_panel_4445125\" class=\"game_info_panel_widget base_widget\"><table><tbody><tr><td>Updated</td><td><abbr title=\"01 September 2026 @ 11:37 UTC\"><span 